SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Nikolaos (patron)\, Ammouliani
LOCATION:Ammouliani\, Ammouliani\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The historic church of Agios Nikolaos\, restored in 2022 with funds from shipowner Athanasios Martinos\, is the island's parish church and its patron's feast on 5-6 December is the one winter day the fishing village fills up\, with vespers\, liturgy and a blessing at the harbour. The ferry from Tripiti takes ten minutes and runs all year.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ammouliani/#ammouliani-feast-of-agios-nikolaos-patron-ammouliani
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ammouliani/#ammouliani-feast-of-agios-nikolaos-patron-ammouliani
END:VEVENT
